  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Ooh... My back...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nOh, pardon me, dear. Are you here to help with my\nrequest?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I lost my ring here in the Dormez Bien Cemetery,\nyou see, and it’s very important that I get it back.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nOoh... Gosh, my poor back...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 138
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I was visiting a loved one’s grave when a wild\nPokémon, of all things, jumped out of nowhere!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nOoh, did it ever give me a fright! I took a tumble\nfrom the shock, and—my! What a mess it was!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 196
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wild Pokémon running all over Lumiose, the\ncemetery turning into a wild zone... Why, I would<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nnever have lost my ring if not for this nonsense!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 1056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 150
    },
    {
      "displayText": "At any rate, it was a Pokémon called Sableye that\njumped out and gave me such an awful fright.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAs I recall, that particular species is weak only to\nthe Fairy type, so mind yourself if you run into it.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 208
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I dropped my ring around the far end of the\ncemetery. I’d start searching there, dear!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s a Sableye... And it looks like it’s holding the\nring you’re searching for!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Will you battle Sableye to get the ring back?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 2128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570069006C006C00200079006F007500200062006100740074006C00650020005300610062006C00650079006500200074006F00200067006500740020007400680065002000720069006E00670020006200610063006B003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll take it on!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 2220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C002000740061006B00650020006900740020006F006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not right now",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00740020007200690067006800740020006E006F00770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "BLEEEIII!!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042004C0045004500450049004900490021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sableye ran off somewhere and left behind the\nCherished Ring.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300610062006C006500790065002000720061006E0020006F0066006600200073006F006D00650077006800650072006500200061006E00640020006C00650066007400200062006500680069006E00640020007400680065000A004300680065007200690073006800650064002000520069006E0067002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sableye was holding the Cherished Ring.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300610062006C006500790065002000770061007300200068006F006C00640069006E006700200074006800650020004300680065007200690073006800650064002000520069006E0067002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You should return the ring to your client!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F0075002000730068006F0075006C0064002000720065007400750072006E0020007400680065002000720069006E006700200074006F00200079006F0075007200200063006C00690065006E0074002100100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hello again, dear. May I ask how the search is\ncoming along?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI do hope a wild Pokémon hasn’t gobbled up my\npoor ring or done anything strange to it...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 158
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh! That’s it—that’s my ring!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00680021002000540068006100742019007300200069007420140074006800610074201900730020006D0079002000720069006E0067002100100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You gave the client her Cherished Ring.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007500200067006100760065002000740068006500200063006C00690065006E007400200068006500720020004300680065007200690073006800650064002000520069006E0067002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What? So that Sableye was carrying my ring\naround, was it?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800610074003F00200053006F002000740068006100740020005300610062006C00650079006500200077006100730020006300610072007200790069006E00670020006D0079002000720069006E0067000A00610072006F0075006E0064002C0020007700610073002000690074003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I didn’t think a wild Pokémon would have such\ngood taste in jewelry.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006400690064006E201900740020007400680069006E006B00200061002000770069006C006400200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200077006F0075006C00640020006800610076006500200073007500630068000A0067006F006F006400200074006100730074006500200069006E0020006A006500770065006C00720079002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But now that I have it back, I won’t let go of this\nring again anytime soon.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIt’s the wedding ring my wonderful husband gave\nme, after all.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 147
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thank you, dear. Truly. And please, take this for\nyour troubles.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680061006E006B00200079006F0075002C00200064006500610072002E0020005400720075006C0079002E00200041006E006400200070006C0065006100730065002C002000740061006B00650020007400680069007300200066006F0072000A0079006F00750072002000740072006F00750062006C00650073002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You know, perhaps I’ll ask someone to place this\nring atop my grave after I’ve passed on.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Who knows? Maybe a Sableye will make off with\nit again.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 4000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570068006F0020006B006E006F00770073003F0020004D0061007900620065002000610020005300610062006C006500790065002000770069006C006C0020006D0061006B00650020006F0066006600200077006900740068000A0069007400200061006700610069006E002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If so, I hope it brings the Sableye some happiness.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIt’s the least I could do to reward its good taste—\nwhether it’s a wild Pokémon or not!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 4120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 147
    },
    {
      "displayText": "After I pass on, I would be honored if a Sableye\ntook care of my ring for me.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIt holds so very many cherished memories...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 129
    }
